From 6fffe225ade637ea520760dc913788caf6660283 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruscher <rruscher@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:56:49 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] clip: A drop on a taken cell inserts there, the icons below
 move down.

Dropping a launcher or a dock-app on a cell of the Clip's grid taken by
another icon was refused: The tile went back, and the only way to put
one first in the Clip's column was to free that cell beforehand. Now the
dropped icon takes the cell, and the icons from there on in the same lane
move one slot away from the Clip, up to the first free cell, as a column
makes room for a tile put between two others. Without room at the end of
the lane, and on the Clip's own tile, the drop is still refused.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
